Annotation(dc:title "MiKaDiv-VIB Concepts"@en)
Annotation(dc:description "Semantic concepts specific to MiKaDiv-VIB, Clearstream's third-party-disclosure data-collection format. No content curated yet -- VIB has no independent legal grounding of its own; see mikadiv-fm for the real statutory basis most VIB concepts will ultimately be grounded against."@en)
